{"reference":"1 Samuel 23","book":"1 Samuel","chapter":23,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"In the Book’s Movement","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"First Samuel traces a movement from Eli’s failing priestly house through Samuel’s prophetic leadership and Saul’s rejected kingship to David’s anointing, rise, exile, and Saul’s death. Chapter 23 belongs within the part of that larger movement in which David is living in exile.","verse_refs":["1 Samuel 1","1 Samuel 10:1-27","1 Samuel 11:1-15","1 Samuel 12:1-25","1 Samuel 13:1-23","1 Samuel 14:1-52","1 Samuel 15:1-35","1 Samuel 16:1-23","1 Samuel 17:1-58","1 Samuel 18:1-30","1 Samuel 19:1-24","1 Samuel 20:1-42","1 Samuel 21:1-15","1 Samuel 22:1-23","1 Samuel 24:1-22","1 Samuel 25:1-44","1 Samuel 26:1-25","1 Samuel 27:1-12","1 Samuel 28:1-25","1 Samuel 29:1-11","1 Samuel 2:1-36","1 Samuel 30:1-31","1 Samuel 31:1-13","1 Samuel 3:1-21","1 Samuel 4:1-22","1 Samuel 5:1-12","1 Samuel 6:1-21","1 Samuel 7:1-17","1 Samuel 8:1-22","1 Samuel 9:1-27"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_samuel_023_833ccae3633a2d5fd87a3da6"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}